{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y对人物反复权衡的因果和反事实思考压缩得更多，少了X中早知道还会不会离开、如果当初没走会怎样等具体自问，人物心理推演不如X完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合一边听音乐一边扫屏：话语中的重点有明确视觉锚点，感受又按音乐进程出现，不必同时处理整堆信息。旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等声音意象反复回来，让记忆、眷恋、孤独和最终的自我决定形成连贯呼应，细腻程度也更高。X的优势是人物为什么犹疑、为什么改变想法交代得更充分，但综合实际观看体验，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "be17dc33-af09-4926-9e8a-bc2c19fe4403", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T232126781788Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:22:05.749894+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "929c58c64d13048fe4354153bc8fd9cadd87ccdfdf1a4c7213a3216c4b1c446d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa